OL,3,AVenezuela releases dozens of political
OL,4,Aprisoners as election calls grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FVenezuelan authorities have released a
OL,7,Fslew of political prisoners, human
OL,8,Frights groups say, days after the
OL,9,Fnation's interim leader met US
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump in New York.
OL,12,FAmong those released in the early hours
OL,13,Fof Saturday morning was Wilder Vasquez,
OL,14,Fwho was handed a five-year sentence in
OL,15,F2018 over claims he was plotting to
OL,16,Fkill former President Nicolas Maduro.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
