OL,3,AVenezuela releases dozens of political
OL,4,Aprisoners as election calls grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition figures have renewed calls
OL,7,Ffor free elections after interim
OL,8,FPresident Delcy Rodriguez held talks
OL,9,Fwith Trump, who captured Maduro earlier
OL,10,Fthis year, at the UN General Assembly
OL,11,Fon Tuesday.
OL,13,FHer administration previously released
OL,14,Fhundreds of prisoners as part of a
OL,15,Freconciliation effort following
OL,16,FMaduro's seizure.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
